          "id": "ogc-prov-chain-object-to-array",
          "description": "Flattens a single-**object** form **OGC PROV Chain** document (`ogc.ogc-utils.prov`),\nwith relation targets inlined and/or supplied via a `has_provenance` sibling list, into\nits flat top-level **array** form (every record referencing others by `id`). Always\napplicable - any single-object OGC PROV Chain document, however deeply nested, can be\nflattened. Purely internal to OGC PROV Chain; does not involve W3C PROV-JSONLD or any\nother W3C PROV representation.\n",
