          "id": "w3c-prov-jsonld-to-ogc-prov-chain",
          "description": "Converts a **W3C PROV-JSONLD** document (`@context`/`@graph`) into the flat **array**\nform of the **OGC PROV Chain** representation (`ogc.ogc-utils.prov`), using the `prov`\nlibrary's PROV-JSONLD parser. Limited to `Entity`/`Activity`/`Agent` core records and the\n`wasGeneratedBy`, `used`, `wasAssociatedWith`, `wasAttributedTo`, `wasDerivedFrom` and\n`actedOnBehalfOf` relations. Output is always the bare-array OGC PROV Chain form with\nfull-IRI identifiers (never the single-object/CURIE form); use the\n`ogc-prov-chain-array-to-object` transform (see the `ogc-prov-chain-forms` block) if a\nsingle-object result is needed and the record graph supports it.\n",
