          "id": "ogc-prov-chain-to-w3c-prov-jsonld",
          "description": "Converts the flat **array** form of an **OGC PROV Chain** document (`ogc.ogc-utils.prov`)\ninto a **W3C PROV-JSONLD** document (`@context`/`@graph`), using the `prov` library's\nPROV-JSONLD serializer. Same record/relation scope as\n`w3c-prov-jsonld-to-ogc-prov-chain`. Requires the bare-array, full-IRI input shape; if the\ninput is instead a single OGC PROV Chain object, first run the\n`ogc-prov-chain-object-to-array` transform (see the `ogc-prov-chain-forms` block).\n",
